"The behavior and configuration of this updater are managed via EM,
enabling flexibility and adaptability across different hardware setups."

Don't include full namespaces, but define and use -

namespace SoftwareIntf = phosphor::software;

Do same at other places.

Lets reduce some chattiness in UT logs. Lets not display everything in the firmware inventory list and use {...} before and after 

    {
    "@odata.id": "/redfish/v1/UpdateService/FirmwareInventory/MB_Retimer_9355"
    },

Would async writing to a file be a responsibility of sdbusplus? Since it is providing the fdio abstraction already.

@paligill@gmail.com Do you think it's worthwhile to implement that in sdbusplus?

@Kevin.Tung@quantatw.com the ```asyncSystem``` may be moved to common code if you find a use for it.
